### Privacy Policy — Receipt Manager for Business

**Last updated:** 2026‑06‑27

Receipt Manager for Business (“the App”) is designed to work **offline**. We do not run servers for the App and we do not collect, transmit, sell, or share your personal data.

### Data the App processes (on device only)
The App may access and store, on your device:
- Receipt photos you scan or import
- Text extracted from receipts using on‑device OCR
- Details you enter or edit (merchant, date, amount, category, notes, etc.)
- Export files you generate (CSV/XLSX/PDF) for sharing

### Data collection
We do **not** collect any data from you. The App does not include analytics, advertising SDKs, or tracking.

### Sharing & exports
When you export and share a file, iOS will display the system Share Sheet. Any sharing occurs only through services you select (e.g., Mail, Files, WhatsApp). We do not receive a copy of the exported file.

### Device permissions
- **Camera**: used only to scan receipts.
- **Photos**: used only to import receipt images.
- **Face ID / Touch ID / Passcode**: used only if you enable app lock.

### Security
All receipts are stored locally in the app’s database on your device. You can delete receipts at any time.

